{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/9362","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/9362/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/9362/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/9362/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/9362","id":1068589341,"node_id":"I_kwDOAjwLdc4_sWEd","number":9362,"title":"Avoid specialized assert formatting when we detect that `__eq__` is overridden","user":{"login":"eivindjahren","id":32731672,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxNjcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32731672?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren","html_url":"https://github.com/eivindjahren","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eivindjahren/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":224849193,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjQ4NDkxOTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"fc2929","default":false,"description":"problem that needs to be addressed"},{"id":702619195,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDI2MTkxOTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/labels/topic:%20rewrite","name":"topic: rewrite","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"related to the assertion rewrite mechanism"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"yuvalshi0","id":21289143,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjg5MTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21289143?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0","html_url":"https://github.com/yuvalshi0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"yuvalshi0","id":21289143,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjg5MTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21289143?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0","html_url":"https://github.com/yuvalshi0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2021-12-01T16:04:40Z","updated_at":"2021-12-14T08:53:57Z","closed_at":"2021-12-14T08:53:57Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The issue reported for introspecting numpy arrays #5347, is still present for dataclasses when invoking `assertrepr_compare`.\r\n\r\nWhen testing:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\n\r\n@dataclass\r\nclass A:\r\n    a: np.ndarray\r\n    \r\n    def __eq__(self, other):\r\n        return np.array_equal(self.a, other.a)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef test_fails():\r\n    assert A(np.array([1,2])) == A(np.array([2,1]))\r\n```\r\n\r\nInstead of an \"Drill down\" explanation you get:\r\n\r\n```\r\n   def test_fails():\r\n>       assert A(np.array([1,2])) == A(np.array([2,1]))\r\nE       assert A(a=array([1, 2])) == A(a=array([2, 1]))\r\nE         (pytest_assertion plugin: representation of details failed: .../_pytest/assertion/util.py:430: ValueError: The truth value of an array with more than one element is ambiguous. Use a.any() or a.all().\r\nE          Probably an object has a faulty __repr__.)\r\n\r\n```\r\n(Ubuntu 21.10, pytest 6.25, python 3.9)\r\n\r\nOne way to solve it: since pytest only sees difference on `repr` perhaps instead of comparing `arr1 == arr2` when determining if the fields are different, perhaps it should consider whether `repr(arr1) == repr(arr2)` which sidesteps the issue with array not returning bool for comparison.\r\n\r\nInstead of \r\nhttps://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/blob/14b79a66a31281c7aa5334f958c9b40aadc259c5/src/_pytest/assertion/util.py#L444-L448\r\n\r\none could do\r\n```python\r\n    for field in fields_to_check:\r\n        if repr(getattr(left, field)) == repr(getattr(right, field)):\r\n            same.append(field)\r\n        else:\r\n            diff.append(field)\r\n```\r\nIf the `__repr__`s are the same and the object are not the same (or vice versa), then the explanation shown by pytest will regardless be misleading.","closed_by":{"login":"yuvalshi0","id":21289143,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjg5MTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21289143?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0","html_url":"https://github.com/yuvalshi0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuvalshi0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/9362/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/9362/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}